   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Think back to your earliest memories of interactions with caregivers or older siblings. Can you recall moments when you were especially attached to a caregiver or very distressed when separated from them? If possible, ask your caregiver about your early experiences. How do these memories or stories align with the concepts of attachment theory?",
